  "scientific_question": "Does an LMAX-inspired preallocated sequenced-ring single-writer control path preserve exact ArcLLM inference semantics while producing a measurable practical improvement in host-side control behavior and/or end-to-end inference metrics versus the current direct orchestration path?",
